3.3.2 Proximity Proof Request Generation

A user U with location l generates a proof request PPR as follows:
\emph{PPR Generation Algorithm:}
\end{quote}

\begin{longtable}[]{@{}
  >{\raggedright\arraybackslash}p{(\columnwidth - 0\tabcolsep) * \real{1.0000}}@{}}
