\begin{quote}
GeneratePPR(pp, l, r) → PPR:\\
1. c = Commit(pp, l, r) = g\^{}l · h\^{}r\\
2. zk\_range = ProveRange(pp, l, r, {[}a,b{]}) 3. σ = Sign\_SK\_U(c
\textbar\textbar{} zk\_range)\\
4. Return PPR = (c, zk\_range, σ)
\end{quote}\strut
\end{minipage} \\
