information about l beyond its inclusion in {[}a,b{]}, formally:\\
For all l₁,l₂ ∈ {[}a,b{]}, the distributions \{GeneratePPR(pp,l₁,r)\}
and \{GeneratePPR(pp,l₂,r)\} are computationally indistinguishable.

