1. R = {[}{]} // Reputation-weighted selection array 2. For each w\_i ∈
W:\\
- p\_i = Rep(w\_i) / ∑\_j Rep(w\_j)\\
- R.append(w\_i) with weight p\_i\\
3. W\textquotesingle{} = WeightedSample(R, k)\\
4. If MinRep(W\textquotesingle) \textless{} t: return SelectWitnesses(W,
k, t) 5. Return W\textquotesingle{}
\end{quote}\strut
