HandleNetworkConditions:\\
1. Exponential backoff:\\
delay = min(base * 2\^{}attempt, max\_delay) 2. Circuit breaker:\\
if failures \textgreater{} threshold:\\
enter\_cooldown\_period()\\
3. Message prioritization:\\
priority = age * importance
\end{quote}\strut
